{
  "video_id": "jE8TA6CKJkU",
  "title": "The guy who built Claude Code stopped writing prompts",
  "description": "Prompting AI one step at a time makes you the bottleneck. Running agents like an org chart, one lead agent splitting the job across sub agents that work in parallel, is how the fastest teams use Claude now. Anthropic's own research reports a 90.2% improvement over a single agent and up to 90% less time, at roughly fifteen times the tokens.\n\nThe exact prompt that makes Claude interview you and build the agent team, plus four ready made setups: https://docs.google.com/document/d/1oQ0p0sbxGLJhSK82miT1LMsS5waTh0fiDE26jOqnDLg/edit?usp=sharing\n\n#Shorts #ClaudeCode #AIAgents",
